# API Contract: SEO/GEO/AEO Optimizer

## Endpoint: `POST /api/v1/optimize/{analysis_id}`

Ejecuta el agente optimizer sobre un análisis SEO/GEO/AEO completado. Genera HTML optimizado, JSON-LD enriquecido, contenido GEO/AEO reescrito, y snippets de código listos para copiar.

### Request

**Method**: `POST`
**Path**: `/api/v1/optimize/{analysis_id}`
**Auth**: Ninguna (público)

| Parámetro | Tipo | Requerido | Descripción |
|-----------|------|-----------|-------------|
| `analysis_id` | integer | Sí | ID del análisis a optimizar |

### Responses

#### 200 OK

```json
{
  "id": 1,
  "analysis_id": 2,
  "optimized_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>...",
  "optimized_json_ld": {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [...]
  },
  "optimized_content": {
    "title": "Modern Dining Chair in Exotic Argentine Wood | Buy Online",
    "meta_description": "Beautiful modern dining chair crafted from exotic Argentine wood...",
    "alt_texts": {
      "/chair.jpg": "Modern dining chair crafted from exotic Argentine wood"
    },
    "geo_content": "¿Buscas una silla de comedor moderna en madera exótica argentina?..."
  },
  "changes": [
    {
      "element": "title",
      "action": "updated",
      "before": "Sax Berlin - Banksy on the Grave Yard Shift",
      "after": "Sax Berlin – Banksy on the Grave Yard Shift | Original Art | Buy",
      "severity": "high",
      "reason": "Title too short and missing primary keyword",
      "snippet": "<title>Sax Berlin – Banksy on the Grave Yard Shift | Original Art | Buy</title>"
    }
  ],
  "score_before": {
    "seo": 55,
    "geo": 30,
    "overall": 42
  },
  "score_after_estimated": {
    "seo": 82,
    "geo": 78,
    "overall": 80
  },
  "status": "completed",
  "error": null,
  "created_at": "2026-08-11T12:00:00Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-11T12:00:00Z"
}
```

| Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `id` | integer | ID de la optimización |
| `analysis_id` | integer | ID del análisis optimizado |
| `optimized_html` | string | HTML completo optimizado |
| `optimized_json_ld` | object | JSON-LD enriquecido final |
| `optimized_content` | object | Contenido reescrito (title, meta desc, alt texts, geo_content) |
| `changes` | array | Lista de cambios aplicados con snippet de código |
| `score_before` | object | Scores SEO/GEO antes de la optimización |
| `score_after_estimated` | object | Scores estimados después de la optimización |
| `status` | string | `pending` / `running` / `completed` / `failed` |
| `error` | string/null | Mensaje de error si falló |
| `created_at` | string (ISO8601) | Timestamp de creación |
| `updated_at` | string (ISO8601) | Timestamp de última actualización |

#### 404 Not Found

```json
{
  "detail": "Analysis with id {analysis_id} not found"
}
```

#### 422 Unprocessable Entity

El análisis está en estado `failed` o no tiene HTML.

```json
{
  "detail": "Cannot optimize analysis with status failed"
}
```

---

## Endpoint: `GET /api/v1/optimize/{analysis_id}`

Recupera la última optimización de un análisis.

### Request

**Method**: `GET`
**Path**: `/api/v1/optimize/{analysis_id}`
**Auth**: Ninguna (público)

| Parámetro | Tipo | Requerido | Descripción |
|-----------|------|-----------|-------------|
| `analysis_id` | integer | Sí | ID del análisis |

### Responses

#### 200 OK

Mismo formato que el response del POST.

#### 404 Not Found

```json
{
  "detail": "No optimization found for analysis with id {analysis_id}"
}
```

---

### Ejemplos con curl

```bash
# Optimizar un análisis
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/optimize/2

# Obtener la optimización de un análisis
curl http://localhost:8000/api/v1/optimize/2